// A for-range `step` at i32's MINIMUM. The checker types `-2147483648` as i32 through
// `intLexemeIs2Pow31`, and the emitter's static step fold admits a negated 2^31, so the
// loop runs its one iteration and stops before the next step leaves the i32 range.
// Should print 10.
for i in 10 to 1 step -2147483648 { print(i) }
